      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-11-19T23:01:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d prefer not. Unless the screen is on, nobody and nothing should need that much accuracy that often, so this should limit abuse.",
      "parentUuid": "d40af2ba_80d0c57a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 294,
