      "writtenOn": "2018-11-19T23:15:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Either is fine. But my point is, it\u0027s charging, so power consumption is not a concern. Also navigation while screen off still prefer accurate cell info, right? Anyway I don\u0027t think it\u0027s a big deal here. GPS is still the most important location source in this case.",
      "parentUuid": "037b0505_d454b8f8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 294,
